<ul>
<li>The <code>project_id</code> for a Neon project is found on the <strong>Settings</strong> page in the Neon Console, or you can find it by listing the projects for your Neon account using the Neon API.</li>
<li>The <code>branch_id</code> can be found by listing the branches for your project. The <code>&lt;branch_id&gt;</code> is the <code>id</code> of a branch. A branch <code>id</code> has a <code>br-</code> prefix. See <a class="" href="#list-branches-with-the-api">List branches</a>.</li>
</ul>
